WEBVTT

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Christianity, Islam, Judaism—

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.500
prefabricated roles in a permanent division.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.500
Battles and trials, enemies assigned,

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.500
secret knowledge always hidden behind

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.000
another locked door, another sacred sign,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.000
another ancient war repeated through time.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.000
These stories were never evidence to me.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.500
They were political machinery.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.500
A script for the crowd, a throne for the few,

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.000
an old manipulation painted as truth.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.000
Empires and spies writing parts for the masses,

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.000
turning human beings into rival factions.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.000
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.500
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.000
The empire made the maze,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.500
then sold you the key.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.000
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.500
The magician behind the curtain is.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.000
The empire plays magician with a carrot and stick,

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.000
hiding its power behind every sacred trick.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.500
It creates the challenge, conceals the prize,

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.000
names your opponent and covers your eyes.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.500
One side is chosen. One side is damned.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:45.000
Both sides are moving by the same hidden hand.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.500
Generations bleed over symbols and names

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.500
while the architects profit from permanent flames.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.500
Faith becomes borders.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.500
Borders become war.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.500
Nobody remembers what the fighting was for.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:07.000
Shared human suffering stretches through time

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:11.500
because division is the oldest imperial design.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.500
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:19.000
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.500
The empire made the maze,

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.000
then sold you the key.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.500
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.000
The magician behind the curtain is.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.000
Break the script.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.500
Reject the role.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.500
Take back the fire they tried to control.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.500
No chosen people.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.000
No sacred elite.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.000
No hidden master standing over the street.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.500
Put the mystery back into ordinary hands.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:03:00.000
Put the spirit back into the hearts of the masses.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:04.000
No institution owns the infinite.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.500
No empire gets to decide who enters it.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.500
This is not the destruction of spiritual force.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:18.000
It is taking that power back to its source.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:22.500
Away from the palace, the temple, the throne—

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.500
returning creation to everyone.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.500
Illuminate empire.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.000
Expose the machine.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:36.500
Destroy every role placed between human beings.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:41.000
The battle was written before we were born,

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.500
but we do not have to keep performing the war.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.500
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.000
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.500
The empire made the maze,

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.000
then sold you the key.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:03.000
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.500
Your neighbor is not the enemy.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.500
Pull back the curtain—

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:13.000
and make the magician leave.
